@bsourdt[1Nov.2025] :: To duplicate a task or a note : TripleDot More Duplicate ; 
♦︎ TickTick v7.8.10 on iPadOS&#39;26.1 ; 
♦︎ 2025.11.10.Md.10:30.iPm.

TickTick is the best app of it&#39;s kind, but to whoever thought a yearly memory was a good idea: What were you thinking?

First, no, I don&#39;t want to grant yet another permission in the world of &#34;grant me permissions&#34;, but more importantly, what kind of stupidity is this possibly going to generate?
&#34;Remember taking the trash out 52 times?&#34;
&#34;How about that time you had to plan that funeral?&#34;
You don&#39;t need more features! Call it complete. Done. A great app that needs nothing else. But, whatever you do, don&#39;t add Task Memories!
